      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "NYC Weekend Watch is our weekly round-up of repertory offerings."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Museum of the Moving Image The Minnellis begins with Cabaret and three by Vincente Minnelli on 35mm; James Gray’s New York features The French Connection ; a Kubrick series continues with Dr. Strangelove on 35mm; Lynne Littman’s Testament shows on 35mm this Saturday.",
