        },
        {
          "text": "Cloverfield",
          "url": "https://www.ifccenter.com/films/cloverfield/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Nitehawk Prospect Park The Devils plays early on Saturday and Sunday—read (or listen to) our interview with Mark Kermode on it—alongside a print of the dubbed Castle in the Sky .",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "The Devils",
          "url": "https://nitehawkcinema.com/prospectpark/movies/the-devils/?date=2026-11-14"
        },
